        <<< Change Log >>>
07/07/2026
	* improved cold plasma collision model. One can directly specify array
	of collision frequecies for electrons and ions.

	** w/o col. : no collision
	** Tc : collision frequency is computed by using Tc as electron temperature
	** nu_col : directly setting nu_col for all species
	** nu_col(array) : setting nu_cols indpendently for each species. Must be array
	                   size of 1 + number of ions. First element is for electrons.

02/10/2026
	* created from PetraM-RF module by separating RF physics for plasma waves
